                                <i class="fas fa-brain text-gold"></i> Bijaksana
                            </span>
                            <span class="bg-cream border border-gold/30 px-3 py-1.5 md:px-4 md:py-2 rounded-lg text-xs font-semibold text-brown flex items-center gap-2 shadow-sm">
